{
  "name": "Elite Dangerous",
  "description": "The ship (landing gear, cargo scoop, lights, flight assist), navigation (frame shift drive, boost, maps), combat and targeting, heat, power distribution and the panels. Elite's own keyboard keys (Options → Controls): change a button's keys if you've changed the game's. Chaff, shield cells and docking requests have no keys to start with in the game: bind them there, then add buttons for them.",
